  "version": "0.1.2",
  "date": "2026-10-12T20:16:06Z",
  "body": "## What's new in Hearken Studio 0.1.2\n\n### More accurate transcription\n- **Accuracy pass:** a larger speech model re-checks each finished sentence, so names, accents and Bible words come out right more often. Checked lines are marked ✓ in the transcript.\n- Download **Small** (190 MB) or **Large v3 Turbo** (574 MB) from the new **Accuracy** button. Each model is speed-tested on your computer, and **Automatic** picks the most accurate one that keeps up.\n- **Names and words to listen for:** add your pastors' names, your church's name and local places so they're transcribed correctly.\n- On computers without a graphics chip, the accuracy pass runs gently in the background so live detection stays fast. Turn it **Off** for the very fastest detection.\n\n### Style your screen\n- New **Style** panel (top bar) slides in beside the Preview, so you see changes as you make them.\n- Eight included fonts, colours, sizes, spacing and alignment, plus six ready-made looks.\n- Nine sample backgrounds, or **upload your own images**, with sliders to darken and soften busy photos.\n- Changes appear in Preview first; nothing reaches the screen until you click **Apply to screen**.\n\n### Find passages faster\n- **Book / Chapter / Verse picker** under the search box: type \"jn\", \"1cor\" or \"ps\", then the chapter and verses. Values are checked against the real chapter and verse counts, and the Preview updates as you type.\n\n### Phones and sharing\n- Friendlier addresses: phones now open **hearken.local** instead of a number address (you can choose the name, e.g. `grace-chapel.local`). The number address and QR code still work for every phone.\n- The congregation page and the phone remote now fit phone screens properly, and the remote keeps its controls in reach while you scroll.\n\n### Fixes\n- The app could feel sluggish: clicks now respond straight away, even while listening.\n- Fixed a problem that could blank the dashboard on newer systems.\n- The Input menu now finds microphones plugged in after the app started.\n- Preview and Live boxes no longer get cut off; panels close when you click outside them.\n\n### Installing\n- **Mac:** open the `.dmg` (Apple Silicon: `aarch64`, Intel: `x64`). The first time, macOS may say it can't verify the developer: open **System Settings → Privacy & Security** and click **Open Anyway**.\n- **Windows:** run the `.exe` installer. If Windows SmartScreen appears, click **More info → Run anyway**.\n- **Already installed?** The app offers this update automatically: click **Install & restart** when you're not listening.\n",
